            "ma_evidence": "\\begin{aligned}\\text{Cov}(x,y) & =\\frac{1}{n}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}({x}_{i}-\\overset{―}{x})({y}_{i}-\\overset{―}{y}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}[(1-6)(2-4)+(4-6)(4-4)+(7-6)(2-4)+(12-6)(8-4)] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}[(-5)(-2)+(-2)(0)+(1)(-2)+(6)(4)] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}[10+0-2+24] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot 32 \\\\  & =8.\\end{aligned}",
